---
const kit = [
  'Waterproof jacket',
  'Base layer',
  'Warm and waterproof gloves',
  'Waterproof pants or long tights',
  'Suncream',
  'Vaseline / Anti Chafe',
  'Fully-charged mobile phone',
  'GPS computer or watch with the Cannon Challenge route loaded',
  'Basic puncture kit (CO2 cannisters, pump, tubes, tyre levers etc)',
];
---

<section class="kit section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="reveal">Suggested Kit</h2>
    <p class="lede reveal">
      Have you got everything you need for a big day out? Cape Town and Table Mountain can be very
      unpredictable with its weather, so please take sufficient cold and warm weather gear with you
      if you think the weather is going to change or you are going to be out there for a long time.
      There are bike shops along the route and East City Cycles in town is highly recommended.
    </p>
    <ul class="kit__list reveal">
      {kit.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .kit {
    padding-block: clamp(2.5rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
  }

  .kit h2 {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .kit .lede {
    max-width: 65rem;
    margin-inline: auto;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .kit__list {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem) clamp(1.75rem, 6vw, 4.25rem);
    background: #000;
    color: #fff;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .kit__list {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  .kit__list li {
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    position: relative;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .kit__list li::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0.5em;
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    background: #fff;
  }
</style>
